## 7. System Architecture

The application follows a client-server architecture.

**Frontend:** The browser-based interface collects financial information and displays results.

**Backend:** The Flask application receives requests, validates and processes inputs, and coordinates the application's functionality.

**Database:** SQLAlchemy communicates with SQLite to manage stored data.

**AI Service:** Gemini AI can be used to generate financial analysis and suggestions when configured.

**Fallback System:** Rule-based logic supports selected workflows when AI services are unavailable.

**Optional Cloud Integration:** Google Apps Script can connect the application to Google Sheets when configured.

### System Flow

User → Web Interface → Flask Backend → Input Processing → Database and AI/Fallback Logic → Results Returned to User

